# Optional local/automation environment variables
#
# Leave REPORT_PASSWORD unset for a public report.
# Set REPORT_PASSWORD through a real secret store for private automation.
# Prefer `npm run setup:cloudflare -- --project <handle> --private`
# for human-run setup so Wrangler prompts securely.
#
# REPORT_PASSWORD=replace-with-a-strong-password
# REPORT_REALM=Private report
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=replace-with-cloudflare-token
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=replace-with-account-id
# CLOUDFLARE_PROJECT_NAME=replace-with-pages-project-name
